OL,3,GNEWSARoad remains closed after
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road has been closed in both
OL,7,Fdirections after a serious
OL,8,Fmulti-vehicle crash.
OL,10,FThe collision happened on the A605
OL,11,Fbetween Warmington in Northamptonshire
OL,12,Fand Elton in Cambridgeshire at about
OL,13,F01:30 GMT.
OL,15,FNorthamptonshire Police said the road
OL,16,Fwould remain closed "for some time".
OL,18,FThe force remains at the scene with
OL,19,Fother emergency services.
